    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwasekudlule isikhathi eside iNkosi isiphumuzile uIsrayeli ezitheni zakhe ezazimhanqile, loJoshuwa wayeselixhegu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabiza wonke uIsrayeli, abadala babo lenhloko zemizi, labahluleli babo lezinduna zabo, wathi kubo: Sengilixhegu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "selizibonele konke iNkosi uNkulunkulu wethu ekwenzileyo kulezizizwe ngenxa yenu, ngoba kwakuyiNkosi uNkulunkulu uqobo eyalilwelayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngilabele kube yilifa lezizwe zenu amazwe ezizwe eziseleyo kanye lawazo zonke izizwe engazichitha kusukela eJordani kuze kube soLwandle olukhulu ngasentshonalanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi uNkulunkulu wenu izazixotsha phambi kwenu, izixotshe ukulenzela indawo, lihlale elizweni lazo, njengokuthembisa kwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke qinani ligcine lenze konke okulotshiweyo ogwalweni lomlayo kaMose, lingaphambuki kuwo liye ngakwesokunene loba ngakwesokhohlo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukuze lingahlangani lezizwe eziseleyo phakathi kwenu, lingabaphathi ngamabizo onkulunkulu bazo, lingafungi ngabo, lingabakhonzi, lingakhothami phambi kwabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodwa libambelele eNkosini uNkulunkulu wenu njengoba lenzile kuze kube lamhla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba iNkosi ixotshile phambi kwenu izizwe ezinkulu lezilamandla; linake kakubanga lamuntu obelamandla ukumelana lani kuze kube lamhla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu oyedwa phakathi kwenu angaxotsha abantu abayinkulungwane, ngoba yiNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu elilwelayo njengokuthembisa kwayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dute 32:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.3.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "3:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaphelisisani ukuyithanda iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba uba libuyela emuva, lizihlanganise lezizwe eziseleyo phakathi kwenu, lithathane lazo ukuba lithathe abesifazana bazo, lazo zithathe abenu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yazinike ukuthi iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu kayiyikuqhubeka ngokuzixotsha lezizizwe phambi kwenu; kodwa zizakuba yisifu lomjibila kini, zibe luswazi emihlana yenu, lameva emehlweni enu, lize libhubhe liphele kulelilizwe elihle, iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu elinika lona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khathesike sengizalitshiya, lonke liyazi enhliziyweni zenu lasemiphefumulweni yenu ukuba kakukho lokukodwa okungenzekanga kuzo zonke izinto ezinhle iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu eyazithembisa ngani; konke kwenzakele, kakukho okukodwa okungenzakalanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa njengalokhu zonke izinto ezinhle iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu eyazithembisa ngani zigcwalisekile, ngakho iNkosi ingalehlisela zonke izinto ezimbi, ize ilibhubhise liphele kulelilizwe elihle iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu elinike lona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba lisaphula isivumelwano seNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu eyalilaya sona, lisuke liyekhonza abanye onkulunkulu, likhothame kibo, ulaka lweNkosi luzakuvutha kini, libhubhe masinyane liphele kulelilizwe elihle elinike lona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
